"
stet  feature/rate-limit  not pushed · 2 not staged · 5 new   v1   v2  now = v2      Round 5   Changes   Drafts 1    ?  
╭─╭─ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 18 more ↓ ─╮─╮
│ │ The thread list                                                                                                  │ │
│ │  j  ↓  ] t            next thread                                                                                │ │
│ │  k  ↑  [ t            previous thread                                                                            │ │
│ │  Enter  l  o          into the thread                                                                            │ │
│ │  g g                  first thread                                                                               │ │
│ │  G                    last thread                                                                                │ │
│ │  Ctrl+D  PgDn         half a page down                                                                           │ │
│ │  Ctrl+U  PgUp         half a page up                                                                             │ │
│ │  J                    first thread of the next file                                                              │ │
│ │  K                    first thread of the previous file                                                          │ │
│ │  n                    next unread thread                                                                         │ │
│ │  N                    previous unread thread                                                                     │ │
│ │  r                    reply to the thread                                                                        │ │
│ │  Esc  h               hide the list (narrow screens)                                                             │ │
│ │  q                    quit                                                                                       │ │
│ │                                                                                                                  │ │
│ │ Moving around                                                                                                    │ │
│ │  h  l  Tab            columns: h left, l right, Tab cycles them; or click a column                               │ │
│ │  Space e  Space s t   the left column's tabs: Files, Threads; or click a tab in its border                       │ │
│ │  s  Space r v         the Drafts and Changes tabs at the top; Esc back to the round; or click them               │ │
│ │  j  k                 in the list: the next / previous thread; in the code and the conversation: scroll          │ │
│ │  J  K                 the first thread of the next / previous file, wherever you are                             │ │
│ │  ]t  [t               the next / previous thread from the code or the conversation                               │ │
│ │  n  N                 the next / previous unread thread                                                          │ │
│ │  mouse                click a row, a tab, a column or a key chip; the wheel scrolls the column under the pointer │ │
│ │  Shift+drag           selects text in most terminals while the mouse is on (Option+drag in iTerm2)               │ │
│ │                                                                                                                  │ │
│ │ Everywhere                                                                                                       │ │
│ │  Space e              the changed files, in the left column                                                      │ │
│ │  Space s t            the threads, in the left column                                                            │ │
│ │  Tab                  next column                                                                                │ │
│ │  Shift+Tab            previous column                                                                            │ │
│ │  S  Space r s         drafts, then S again submits: request changes (approve when there are no drafts)           │ │
│ │  s  Space r d         your drafts                                                                                │ │
│ │  Space r v            changes since you last looked                                                              │ │
│ │  R  Space r r         re-read “now” from the working tree                                                        │ │
╰─╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯─╯
